              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 21.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I saw the Lamb break open the sixth seal. There was a violent earthquake, and the sun became black like coarse black cloth, and the moon turned completely red like blood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.34.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 34.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The stars fell down to the earth, like unripe figs falling from the tree when a strong wind shakes it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.16.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 16.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sky disappeared like a scroll being rolled up, and every mountain and island was moved from its place. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.2.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 2.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.2.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the kings of the earth, the rulers and the military chiefs, the rich and the powerful, and all other people, slave and free, hid themselves in caves and under rocks on the mountains. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.10.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 10.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.23.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 23.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They called out to the mountains and to the rocks, “Fall on us and hide us from the eyes of the one who sits on the throne and from the anger of the Lamb! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
